          <attvalue for="34" value="0.6" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="More effective extraterritorial/secondary pressure constrains suppliers and maintenance providers for Western-made radars, sensors and spare parts, degrading operational performance and readiness rates of deployed air‑defence systems in the Ukraine theatre within procurement and repair cycles." />
