          <attvalue for="28" value="2" />
          <attvalue for="34" value="0.6" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="A tightening of trade finance and correspondent banking for affected trade lanes raises transaction costs and payment risk for cross‑border deals, causing investors and foreign corporate buyers to delay or withhold capital allocations into AI hardware manufacturing and startups that rely on those imports." />
