          <attvalue for="34" value="0.6" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="Sustained rises in long-term yields increase borrowing and hedging costs for European purchasers and defense contractors and raise the cash-flow burden on procurement, leading buyers and suppliers to delay or scale back deliveries of defensive systems." />
