          <attvalue for="28" value="2" />
          <attvalue for="34" value="0.65" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="Sustained increases in long-term yields raise the cost of capital and favor large, cash-rich incumbents over smaller, capital-intensive challengers, accelerating M&amp;A and capacity consolidation in AI hardware and cloud services." />
