          <attvalue for="35" value="Tightening of AI-targeted accelerator supply (fewer available GPUs/TPUs) reduces the processing headroom for real‑time sensor fusion and ML-based tracking on fielded air‑defence nodes, lowering detection/engagement success rates." />
