          <attvalue for="35" value="When AI activity and cash reserves are highly concentrated in a few firms, an idiosyncratic shock to one dominant player (sanctions, outage, or large emergency capex) can trigger synchronized large sell orders or margin calls in the Treasury cash and futures market, spiking liquidity stress and disorderly price moves." />
