          <attvalue for="34" value="0.65" />
          <attvalue for="35" value="Higher bilateral supply‑chain integration supports a wider set of regional suppliers and OEM partnerships, whereas a decline (from trade frictions) forces sourcing to a smaller number of large, vertically integrated global providers, increasing concentration." />
